格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Plugin that supports MCP Apps","id":"gh:1334380319","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-mcp-apps","slug":"sugarforever/dsh-mcp-apps","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Plugin that supports MCP Apps"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DeepSeek Harness MCP Apps"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"`@sugarforever/dsh-mcp-apps` is a dual-face Cordis plugin that makes DeepSeek Harness an MCP Apps ho"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ugarforever/dsh-mcp-apps` is a dual-face Cordis plugin that makes DeepSeek Harness an MCP Apps host."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The Host half connects to one MCP Server, registers its model-visible tools on `ctx.tools`, and owns"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" all MCP network or stdio traffic. The Web Client half renders tools carrying `_meta.ui.resourceUri`"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" as sandboxed interactive Apps inside the Harness conversation."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it supports"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- MCP Apps extension negotiation: `io.modelcontextprotocol/ui`\n- `text/html;profile=mcp-app` UI reso"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"urces\n- Modern `_meta.ui.resourceUri` and legacy `_meta[\"ui/resourceUri\"]`\n- stdio and Streamable HT"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"TP MCP transports\n- Model-visible, App-visible, and App-only tools\n- Original `CallToolResult` deliv"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ery to the View, including `structuredContent`\n- View-to-Server `tools/call`, `resources/list`, and "},{"id":"p6s5","text":"`resources/read`\n- Resource CSP metadata and iframe Permission Policy requests\n- Cordis lifecycle di"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"sposal for tools, connections, RPC routes, Slots, and App bridges"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Plain MCP tools remain plain Harness tools. An MCP Server does not need to provide a UI for every to"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"in MCP tools remain plain Harness tools. An MCP Server does not need to provide a UI for every tool."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness currently requires Node.js `^22.19.0` or `>=24.0.0`. Its profile plugin manager als"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"o invokes `pnpm`; install the version used by the current DSH release:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Then start the Web profile without a global DSH installation:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The Web UI is served at <http://127.0.0.1:3080> by default. The first run initializes the `web` prof"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ile under `~/.dsh/profiles/web` (or `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web` when `DSH_HOME` is set)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install the plugin"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Install the published package into the DSH Web profile:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"For local development, install this checkout instead:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"You can also install a tarball downloaded from a GitHub Release:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The package is a DSH bundle. Installing it also applies its bundled `cordis.patch.yml`, which mounts"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" the public VibeFun MCP Apps server at `https://vibefun.app/api/mcp` by default."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"To connect a different server, edit the installed profile patch at `~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch"},{"id":"p22s2","text":".yml` and replace the generated instance configuration. The relevant entry is:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Start or restart DSH and open <http://127.0.0.1:3080>:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"To remove the package dependency:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The plugin manager also removes the bundle patch contributed by the package."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Configure a stdio Server"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Create `mcp-apps.cordis.yml`:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Run the Harness Web profile with the overlay:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Configure a Streamable HTTP Server"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"The browser never receives the URL, command, headers, environment, or credentials. Its package-priva"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"te RPC channel is loopback-only."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Develop"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The integration test starts a real stdio MCP Apps Server and verifies discovery, tool execution, str"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"uctured output, resource reading, and teardown."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Publish"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"The repository includes `.github/workflows/publish.yml`. Publishing a GitHub Release runs the comple"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"te release gate, creates an npm tarball, uploads it as a workflow artifact and GitHub Release asset,"},{"id":"p41s3","text":" and publishes the same tarball to npm. Reruns are safe: when that exact npm version already exists,"},{"id":"p41s4","text":" the workflow skips the immutable npm publication and still completes the GitHub artifacts."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"The workflow uses npm Trusted Publishing with GitHub OIDC, so it does not require an `NPM_TOKEN` sec"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"workflow uses npm Trusted Publishing with GitHub OIDC, so it does not require an `NPM_TOKEN` secret."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"### One-time npm setup"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"1. If `@sugarforever/dsh-mcp-apps` does not exist on npm yet, publish the first version locally:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"2. On npmjs.com, open the package's **Settings → Trusted Publisher**, choose **GitHub Actions**, and"},{"id":"p46s2","text":".com, open the package's **Settings → Trusted Publisher**, choose **GitHub Actions**, and configure:"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"- Organization or user: `sugarforever`\n- Repository: `dsh-mcp-apps`\n- Workflow filename: `publish.ym"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"l`\n- Allowed action: `npm publish`"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"3. Do not add an environment name unless the workflow is also updated to use that exact GitHub envir"},{"id":"p48s2","text":"ot add an environment name unless the workflow is also updated to use that exact GitHub environment."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"### Release a new version"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"Update and commit the package version, then push the matching tag:"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"Create and publish a GitHub Release for that tag. For example, package version `0.1.1` must use tag "},{"id":"p52s2","text":"`v0.1.1`. Publishing the Release triggers the workflow; a mismatched tag fails before npm publicatio"},{"id":"p52s3","text":"0.1.1`. Publishing the Release triggers the workflow; a mismatched tag fails before npm publication."},{"id":"p53s1","text":"Before creating a Release, the same checks can be run locally:"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"See docs/architecture.md and docs/security.md."},{"id":"p58s1","text":"## Current limitations"},{"id":"p59s1","text":"- One plugin instance owns one MCP Server. Mount multiple instances for multiple Servers.\n- UI tool "},{"id":"p59s2","text":"discovery occurs at Client plugin activation. A Server changing its UI tool list requires a Client r"},{"id":"p59s3","text":"efresh or plugin reload.\n- Prompts, sampling, downloads, external-link opening, and model-context up"},{"id":"p59s4","text":"dates are not exposed to Apps yet.\n- App HTML is loaded with `srcdoc`; Apps should ship self-contain"},{"id":"p59s5","text":"ed HTML or declare every remote origin in resource CSP metadata.\n- The current iframe path targets t"},{"id":"p59s6","text":"he Web client. Headless and ACP entry points still receive the tools but have no embedded App surfac"},{"id":"p59s7","text":" Web client. Headless and ACP entry points still receive the tools but have no embedded App surface."},{"id":"p60s1","text":"## Protocol references"},{"id":"p61s1","text":"- MCP Apps overview\n- Official MCP Apps SDK\n- DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p62s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p63s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
